# The repo stores text files with LF on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf is set
# to. Checkouts use the platform's line endings: CRLF on Windows, LF on Linux and CI.
* text=auto

# Generated data. pandas writes the platform's line endings (to_csv uses os.linesep),
# which match the checkout, so a local run only shows real data changes. Git converts
# them to LF on commit.
data/*.csv text
